  "summary": "I'm a full-stack engineer who builds the platforms other engineers build on, from Kafka and Kubernetes services up to React apps and the AI agents that use them.\n\nAt Zillow I'm the technical lead on the Eventing Platform, the Kafka control plane teams use to define, govern, and provision events. I built its v2 API, designed its authorization model, and own the Kubernetes controller that provisions its infrastructure.\n\nI also architect the Data Platform's agentic layer: zData, a Claude agent in our web app and Slack; Event Studio, which turns a product spec into governed event schemas; and the MCP servers that let any agent work against the platform safely. I lead the React and Next.js app that hosts all of it.\n\nI care about turning fragile, manual platform work into safe, self-serve paths for people and agents alike.",
