      "description": "• Architected the Data Platform's agentic foundation: one MCP server and CLI that give every AI agent a capability index, shared skills, and typed tools, with a contribution model for 7 platform teams.\n• Lead the Data Platform UI, a Next.js and React monorepo that puts 13 products behind one shell, with a shared design system and CI quality gates.\n• Built zData, a Claude agent in the web app and Slack, with user-scoped permissions, approval before writes, resumable streaming, and sandboxed code execution.\n• Built Event Studio, an AI app that turns a product spec into governed event schemas. Recognized by Zillow's CTO and used for the first production pilot with Trulia.\n• Built version 2 of the Eventing Platform API on Kafka, plus its MCP server and a shared skill library that every agent uses, tested with A/B evals.\n• Owned the Kubernetes provisioning controller (Java/Kotlin): a deterministic naming fix removed about 45K redundant syncs every 30 minutes.\n• Diagnosed a network-cost spike in event ingress and designed a fix that cuts that cost by about 90%.",
      "insights": ""
     },
