      "totalDuration": "3 yrs 6 mos",
      "description": "• Shipped the Eventing Platform's GA in six months, including a React schema editor that cut the time to create an event from days to about 30 minutes.\n• Designed the platform's authorization model on OpenFGA, with ownership inherited from domain to namespace to event, and added self-service Kafka access between teams.\n• Tech lead on the GraphQL federation gateway: migrated it from Node.js to Rust (Apollo Router), cutting Kubernetes pods from 300 to 40.\n• Built operation safelisting end to end (Rust, Go, Terraform, React), onboarding 52 teams and cutting unknown queries 95%.\n• Built Shadow Runner, a tool that replays production traffic to validate subgraph migrations, and taught Federation 2.0 to 100+ engineers.",
